# The default GIF_MGET releases the frame buffer through realloc(m, 0), which
# valgrind reports even though both C89 and C99 allow it. Callers that target
# C23, where the construct became undefined, are expected to supply their own
# GIF_MGET; see the README.
{
   gif_load_frees_through_realloc_with_zero_size
   Memcheck:ReallocZero
   fun:realloc
   ...
}
